{"ref":"BDB, תִּשְׁעִים","hw":"תִּשְׁעִים","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">תִּשְׁעִים</span></big><sub>20</sub>  <strong>n. indecl. ninety (</strong>archaic pl., DHM<sup>ZMG xxxvii (1883), 9 f.</sup> Prät<sup>BAS i. 376</sup>, but cf.Ges<sup>§ 97 f.</sup><strong>)</strong>;—before n. sg.: <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:9\" href=\"/Genesis.5.9\">Gn 5:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:17\" href=\"/Genesis.17.17\">17:17</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַמָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.12\">Ez 41:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.5\">Ez 4:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.9\">9</a>; less often after n.pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:35\" href=\"/Ezra.8.35\">Ezr 8:35</a>, cf.<a data-ref=\"Daniel 12:11\" href=\"/Daniel.12.11\">Dn 12:11</a>; in combination, <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> precedes units <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.15\">1 S 4:15</a> + 7 times; foll. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:17\" href=\"/Genesis.5.17\">Gn 5:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:30\" href=\"/Genesis.5.30\">30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> foll. 100 <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.5\">Ez 4:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.9\">9</a> + 4 times","next":null,"prev":"BDB, תְּשִׁיעִי"}